    <assignments>
        <name>Set_Email_Template_Variables</name>
        <label>Set Email Template Variables</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>431</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>EmailSubject</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>CVMA Event Registration Confirmed - {!EventRecord.Name}</stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>EmailBody</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Dear {!ContactRecord.FirstName},

Thank you for registering for the CVMA Chapter 20-7 event: {!EventRecord.Name}

EVENT DETAILS:
- Event: {!EventRecord.Name}
- Date: {!EventRecord.StartDateTime}
- Location: {!EventRecord.Location}
- Type: {!EventRecord.Type}

WHAT TO EXPECT:
• You will receive reminder emails 1 week and 1 day before the event
• Event updates will be posted in our Chatter group
• RSVP confirmations help us plan appropriate resources
• Mobile check-in will be available at the event

MOBILE ACCESS:
Access the CVMA member portal through the Salesforce mobile app for:
- Real-time event updates
- Photo sharing and event feed
- Check-in and attendance confirmation
- Direct messaging with event organizers

CONTACT INFORMATION:
Event Coordinator: {!EventRecord.Owner.Name}
Email: events@cvma20-7.org
Phone: (904) 555-CVMA

We look forward to seeing you at this event!

Vets Serving Vets
Combat Veterans Motorcycle Association
Chapter 20-7 - Jacksonville, FL

This message was sent via automated communication workflow.</stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Send_Event_Registration_Email</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
